WEBVTT

00:16:58.375 --> 00:17:01.184
so that they can track
influenza patterns every year.

00:17:01.208 --> 00:17:03.809
CA: So tell me if I understand this right.

00:17:03.833 --> 00:17:06.934
You would carry on your phone an app

00:17:06.958 --> 00:17:11.184
that would, when you got,
say, within six feet

00:17:11.208 --> 00:17:13.518
of another human carrying that app,

00:17:13.542 --> 00:17:17.226
the phones would exchange a Bluetooth --
using Bluetooth technology

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:19.518
they exchange a kind of token

00:17:19.542 --> 00:17:21.101
that says, "Hi, we connected."

00:17:21.125 --> 00:17:22.417
But it's encrypted.

00:17:23.375 --> 00:17:26.393
And that is not communicated
to a central server,

00:17:26.417 --> 00:17:28.268
that is on the phone.

00:17:28.292 --> 00:17:31.059
But if either of you